  "description": "Inheriting all the advantages of its previous two generations, the VELOCI PLAN Big V.3 has undergone further optimization in details, making its overall design even closer to perfection. By extending the distance from the bottom bracket center to the top of the head tube, and by increasing the height from the bottom bracket center to the top of the head tube, the VELOCI PLAN Big V.3 offers riders a more upright riding posture. This not only makes long-distance riding more comfortable but also provides more room for the upper body to stretch. Whether you want to install drop bars or flat bars, this setup allows you to equip other components more easily and seamlessly switch your riding style.\n\nMoreover, the design of the bent rear end of the top tube not only gives the VELOCI PLAN Big V.3 a unique appearance but, more importantly, significantly lowers the frame's standover height, making it easier to get on and off the bike, even when it's loaded with luggage.\n\nThe VELOCI PLAN Big V.3 is not just a steel bike or a touring bike; it embodies a riding lifestyle. Whether you're commuting through the city or on a multi-day bike packing trip, it's your most reliable companion.",
